@57531, thank you for sharing those concerns! However, before NAFTA was enacted some of these issues were already present due to previous international agreements and market trends that made corporations look overseas for manufacturing sites... So isn’t it fair to say that while NAFTA exacerbated existing problems; many businesses did benefit locally by having easy global connections?

